{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/AttributesNSImpl","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"AttributesNSImpl","name":"AttributesNSImpl","kind":"class","parent":null,"signatures":["AttributesNSImpl(attrs, qnames)"],"doc":"Namespace-aware variant of AttributesImpl, which will be passed to startElementNS(). It is derived from AttributesImpl, but understands attribute names as two-tuples of namespaceURI and localname. In addition, it provides a number of methods expecting qualified names as they appear in the original document. This class implements the AttributesNS interface (see section The AttributesNS Interface).","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.AttributesNSImpl","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":339},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"IncrementalParser","name":"IncrementalParser","kind":"class","parent":null,"signatures":["IncrementalParser(bufsize=65536)"],"doc":"This interface adds four extra methods to the XMLReader\ninterface that allow XML parsers to support incremental\nparsing. Support for this interface is optional, since not all\nunderlying XML parsers support this functionality.\n\nWhen the parser is instantiated it is ready to begin accepting\ndata from the feed method immediately. After parsing has been\nfinished with a call to close the reset method must be called to\nmake the parser ready to accept new data, either from feed or\nusing the parse method.\n\nNote that these methods must _not_ be called during parsing, that\nis, after parse has been called and before it returns.\n\nBy default, the class also implements the parse method of the XMLReader\ninterface using the prepareParser, feed and close methods of the\nIncrementalParser interface as a convenience to SAX 2.0 driver\nwriters.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.IncrementalParser","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":91},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser.close","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"IncrementalParser.close","name":"close","kind":"method","parent":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser","signatures":["IncrementalParser.close()"],"doc":"This method is called when the entire XML document has been\npassed to the parser through the feed method, to notify the\nparser that there are no more data. This allows the parser to\ndo the final checks on the document and empty the internal\ndata buffer.\n\nThe parser will not be ready to parse another document until\nthe reset method has been called.\n\nclose may raise SAXException.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.IncrementalParser.close","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":141},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser.feed","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"IncrementalParser.feed","name":"feed","kind":"method","parent":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser","signatures":["IncrementalParser.feed(data)"],"doc":"This method gives the raw XML data in the data parameter to\nthe parser and makes it parse the data, emitting the\ncorresponding events. It is allowed for XML constructs to be\nsplit across several calls to feed.\n\nfeed may raise SAXException.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.IncrementalParser.feed","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":127},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser.prepareParser","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"IncrementalParser.prepareParser","name":"prepareParser","kind":"method","parent":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser","signatures":["IncrementalParser.prepareParser(source)"],"doc":"This method is called by the parse implementation to allow\nthe SAX 2.0 driver to prepare itself for parsing.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.IncrementalParser.prepareParser","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":136},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser.reset","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"IncrementalParser.reset","name":"reset","kind":"method","parent":"xml.sax.xmlreader/IncrementalParser","signatures":["IncrementalParser.reset()"],"doc":"This method is called after close has been called to reset\nthe parser so that it is ready to parse new documents. The\nresults of calling parse or feed after close without calling\nreset are undefined.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.IncrementalParser.reset","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":154},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/InputSource","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"InputSource","name":"InputSource","kind":"class","parent":null,"signatures":["InputSource(system_id=None)"],"doc":"Encapsulation of the information needed by the XMLReader to\nread entities.\n\nThis class may include information about the public identifier,\nsystem identifier, byte stream (possibly with character encoding\ninformation) and/or the character stream of an entity.\n\nApplications will create objects of this class for use in the\nXMLReader.parse method and for returning from\nEntityResolver.resolveEntity.\n\nAn InputSource belongs to the application, the XMLReader is not\nallowed to modify InputSource objects passed to it from the\napplication, although it may make copies and modify those.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.InputSource","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":187},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
{"id":"xml.sax.xmlreader/InputSource.getByteStream","module":"xml.sax.xmlreader","qualname":"InputSource.getByteStream","name":"getByteStream","kind":"method","parent":"xml.sax.xmlreader/InputSource","signatures":["InputSource.getByteStream()"],"doc":"Get the byte stream for this input source.\n\nThe getEncoding method will return the character encoding for\nthis byte stream, or None if unknown.","docsUrl":"https://docs.python.org/3.15/library/xml.sax.reader.html#xml.sax.xmlreader.InputSource.getByteStream","added":null,"changed":[],"deprecated":null,"availability":[],"source":{"path":"Lib/xml/sax/xmlreader.py","line":253},"implDetail":false,"isAsync":false},
